{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010The demo now supports 1\u20134 player co-op\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to dive into a colorful, surprise-filled adventure? Run your very own restaurant in the bustling heart of Paris \u2014 the most visited city in the world. Soak in the authentic Parisian atmosphere, with Haussmann-style buildings and stunning views of the Eiffel Tower, while embracing the charm of French cuisine. Create seasonal menus, optimize your staff, and boost customer satisfaction to turn your humble brasserie into a true Parisian institution!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058360/extras/dcf02a99c4fac3f4847180c0c5eaee9f.avif?t=1757590884\" width=616 height=72 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the owner of a cozy little restaurant tucked away on a lively Parisian avenue, your grand opening day is finally here. Carefully set up your space, arrange tables and chairs, order your first batch of quality ingredients, and craft a mouthwatering menu to win over your future guests. Once everything\u2019s ready, open your doors and welcome your very first customers \u2014 your culinary journey begins now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058360/extras/ee4086f547dfa548992854753de5b73d.poster.avif?t=1757590884\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058360/extras/ee4086f547dfa548992854753de5b73d.webm?t=1757590884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058360/extras/ee4086f547dfa548992854753de5b73d.mp4?t=1757590884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058360/extras/1ff388c70ba6fbdd31c74681b2c9f734.avif?t=1757590884\" width=616 height=72 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the doors are open, efficient service becomes key. Organize your team, assign tasks, and make sure every customer is served quickly and with a smile. Seat guests strategically, manage orders, and ensure that every visitor leaves your brasserie happy\u2026 and with the bill paid! The success of your restaurant depends on the quality of your service.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058360/extras/bcf565a56e618ab4b7c7c135564a026b.poster.avif?t=1757590884\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058360/extras/bcf565a56e618ab4b7c7c135564a026b.webm?t=1757590884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058360/extras/bcf565a56e618ab4b7c7c135564a026b.mp4?t=1757590884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058360/extras/42f641969f5add0f97dd473b302ca805.avif?t=1757590884\" width=616 height=72 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Effective management of goods and profit margins is crucial for the profitability of your brasserie. Closely monitor your raw material supplies, avoid waste, and negotiate with suppliers to get the best prices. Use management tools to analyze costs, adjust prices, and maximize profits while providing quality products to your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058360/extras/65dcf62dea3ed9a95ca019e22e7245f1.poster.avif?t=1757590884\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058360/extras/65dcf62dea3ed9a95ca019e22e7245f1.webm?t=1757590884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058360/extras/65dcf62dea3ed9a95ca019e22e7245f1.mp4?t=1757590884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058360/extras/628af8903ed4e50efb3e6d1ba1c294ba.avif?t=1757590884\" width=616 height=72 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To expand your brasserie, you will need to meet a number of criteria, such as customer satisfaction, profitability, and service quality. By achieving these goals, you will unlock new opportunities to grow your establishment and add new recipes to your menu. Each milestone reached will allow you to diversify your offerings and attract an even larger clientele, gradually transforming your brasserie into a true Parisian institution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058360/extras/8f45e53da9caded748c2f092af7e9d0d.poster.avif?t=1757590884\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058360/extras/8f45e53da9caded748c2f092af7e9d0d.webm?t=1757590884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058360/extras/8f45e53da9caded748c2f092af7e9d0d.mp4?t=1757590884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Burger Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3058360/c8fd02447fc465b8ea7ad3a7cf0976a5419842c4.jpg"},{"name":"An American","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3058360/c8fd02447fc465b8ea7ad3a7cf0976a5419842c4.jpg"},{"name":"In Vino Veritas","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3058360/2ad0e8de90f934ef2e6b71f9322eece6146cfd58.jpg"},{"name":"Mmm\u2026 I can taste fruity notes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3058360/2ad0e8de90f934ef2e6b71f9322eece6146cfd58.jpg"},{"name":"*Hic!* Another One...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3058360/2ad0e8de90f934ef2e6b71f9322eece6146cfd58.jpg"},{"name":"It\u2019s fruitier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3058360/6277339a67855e138da0159fa87a3af7313526c4.jpg"},{"name":"I still prefer red wine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3058360/6277339a67855e138da0159fa87a3af7313526c4.jpg"},{"name":"Actually\u2026 I love ros\u00e9, it\u2019s my favorite!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3058360/6277339a67855e138da0159fa87a3af7313526c4.jpg"},{"name":"Lasciatemi cantare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3058360/1cea5d6e8fdf1c353920e08f065d9a47aa311b3f.jpg"},{"name":"Strong and Bold","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3058360/1cea5d6e8fdf1c353920e08f065d9a47aa311b3f.jpg"}],"total":33},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3058360?t=1757590884","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058360/ea22cfd00699cbdbad5e70258e32dc9d5e54c039/page_b